405
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:19,120
Don't shut yourself off.

406
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:20,120
Yeah, but honestly,

407
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:21,240
sometimes I feel

408
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,520
