444
00:13:29,040 --> 00:13:30,200
Over two years.

445
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:31,640
I really like my coworkers.

446
00:13:31,640 --> 00:13:32,680
So overall,

447
00:13:32,680 --> 00:13:34,480
