00:17:33,280 --> 00:17:33,960
Bye, guys.

591
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:34,720
Bye.

592
00:17:34,720 --> 00:17:35,520
See you later.

593
00:17:35,520 --> 00:17:36,280
See you tonight.

594
00:17:37,360 --> 00:17:37,960
Have you noticed

595
00:17:37,960 --> 00:17:39,000
how quickly I

596
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:40,120
switch gears?

597
00:17:40,220 --> 00:17:41,140
(Glances)

598
00:17:42,040 --> 00:17:43,000
What do you mean, switch gears?

599
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:44,280
Like your brain?

600
00:17:44,280 --> 00:17:45,160
Like...

601
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:46,880
Yeah, with everything.

602
00:17:46,880 --> 00:17:48,840
My thoughts jump around a lot.

603
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:49,960
Like?

604
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:51,280
My brain will suddenly

605
00:17:51,280 --> 00:17:53,560
jump from one thing to something else.

606
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:54,880
Same.

607
00:17:54,880 --> 00:17:55,840
Yeah.

608
00:17:55,840 --> 00:17:56,440
Like,

609
00:17:56,440 --> 00:17:58,040
what'd you get in Chinese class?

610
00:17:58,340 --> 00:17:59,120
(Cracks up)

611
00:17:59,120 --> 00:18:01,160
It gets really random.

612
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:04,000
And that song, When I Like You,

613
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:06,440
What's Going Through Your Mind?

614
00:18:07,240 --> 00:18:08,640
When I Like You...

615
00:18:08,640 --> 00:18:09,840
What's Going Through My Mind

616
00:18:09,840 --> 00:18:11,040
(Together)
When I Fall for You.

617
00:18:11,040 --> 00:18:11,880
Yeah.

618
00:18:12,620 --> 00:18:14,620
(Laughs)

619
00:18:14,640 --> 00:18:15,480
The song title is complicated.

620
00:18:16,120 --> 00:18:18,960
What Goes Through My Mind
When I Fall for You.

621
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:22,560
What Goes Through My Mind
When I Fall for You.

622
00:18:22,560 --> 00:18:23,840
That's complicated too.

623
00:18:23,840 --> 00:18:25,240
It's "what goes through my mind".

624
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:26,020
(Laughs)

625
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:30,400
Would you say you're...

626
00:18:30,620 --> 00:18:32,080
(Turns to listen)

627
00:18:32,080 --> 00:18:33,520
A serious person?

628
00:18:34,120 --> 00:18:34,920
Serious?

629
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:37,240
I don't think I'm serious at all.

630
00:18:37,700 --> 00:18:38,880
(Glances)

631
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:39,920
Why?

632
00:18:40,720 --> 00:18:42,400
Do I seem serious

633
00:18:42,400 --> 00:18:44,560
