634
00:18:44,800 --> 00:18:46,520
From your perspective.

635
00:18:47,280 --> 00:18:47,960
Honestly,

636
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:50,640
compared to everyone else...

637
00:18:50,640 --> 00:18:51,400
I'm a bit more serious?

638
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:52,040
I guess.

639
00:18:52,040 --> 00:18:53,560
Yeah, you're very...

640
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:55,640
(Upright and proper)
proper.

641
00:18:59,000 --> 00:18:59,880
Very...

642
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:01,400
well...

643
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:02,080
Well-behaved.

644
00:19:02,080 --> 00:19:03,080
