Behaved.

645
00:19:03,080 --> 00:19:04,360
You could say that.

646
00:19:04,360 --> 00:19:05,040
Very well-behaved.

647
00:19:06,200 --> 00:19:08,120
Very...

648
00:19:08,120 --> 00:19:08,740
