649
00:19:09,180 --> 00:19:09,880
(Stares)

650
00:19:09,880 --> 00:19:10,840
Good?

651
00:19:10,840 --> 00:19:11,560
Good and well-behaved.

652
00:19:11,560 --> 00:19:11,960
Yeah.

653
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:13,760
But I think that's nice.

654
00:19:14,040 --> 00:19:15,120
Isn't the contrast cute?

655
00:19:15,940 --> 00:19:17,300
(Smiles)

656
00:19:17,320 --> 00:19:17,920
Really?

657
00:19:20,320 --> 00:19:21,560
Like on the first day,

658
00:19:22,640 --> 00:19:24,520
