660
00:19:26,240 --> 00:19:27,200
Yeah.

661
00:19:27,200 --> 00:19:29,600
I was definitely a little...

662
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:31,000
Nervous?

663
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:32,640
I wasn't nervous.

664
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:35,000
I was just socially anxious that day.

665
00:19:36,880 --> 00:19:38,480
So you're socially anxious.

666
00:19:38,480 --> 00:19:40,360
Yeah, I was that day.

667
00:19:41,640 --> 00:19:44,200
I'm actually trying to change myself.

668
00:19:44,200 --> 00:19:45,120
You don't have to force it.

669
00:19:45,120 --> 00:19:46,280
I think

670
00:19:46,280 --> 00:19:47,400
