671
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:47,960
Yeah.

672
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:49,000
Go at your own pace.

673
00:19:52,360 --> 00:19:54,000
You're unusually lively today.

674
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:54,920
You've been great today.

675
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:55,520
Yeah.

676
00:19:55,520 --> 00:19:57,040
I'm just happy being with you guys.

677
00:19:57,040 --> 00:19:59,120
The moment Si impressed me most today

678
00:19:59,120 --> 00:20:01,260
was when she was facing the sunset,

679
00:20:01,260 --> 00:20:01,960
walking across the grass,

680
00:20:01,960 --> 00:20:03,040
and confidently called out,

681
00:20:03,040 --> 00:20:03,820
(Looks)
"Sun Bohan!"

682
00:20:03,820 --> 00:20:04,160
Like that.

683
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:05,040
I remember thinking,

684
00:20:05,040 --> 00:20:07,320
(Fidgets)
Si feels so lively today.

685
00:20:07,320 --> 00:20:08,560
And her eyes are so round,

686
00:20:08,560 --> 00:20:09,680
cute and big.

687
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:10,720
But she's

688
00:20:10,720 --> 00:20:11,840
not just cute and clueless.

689
00:20:11,840 --> 00:20:14,320
She remembers everything.

690
00:20:14,320 --> 00:20:15,440
But she still holds

691
00:20:15,440 --> 00:20:16,960
onto that sweet innocence.

692
00:20:17,600 --> 00:20:18,680
Thanks.

693
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:20,320
We really saw a different side of you.

694
00:20:20,320 --> 00:20:20,680
You

695
00:20:20,680 --> 00:20:21,640
