696
00:20:21,640 --> 00:20:22,920
Yeah, I felt that too.

697
00:20:22,920 --> 00:20:24,080
Yeah, today really felt different.

698
00:20:24,080 --> 00:20:25,320
See? This is why

699
00:20:25,320 --> 00:20:26,240
