703
00:20:32,280 --> 00:20:33,480
Everyone holds back a little.

704
00:20:33,480 --> 00:20:33,920
Yeah.

705
00:20:33,920 --> 00:20:36,960
With fewer people,

706
00:20:36,960 --> 00:20:38,040
