711
00:20:42,680 --> 00:20:46,040
Yeah, they're in their own little world.

712
00:20:46,040 --> 00:20:46,640
Yeah.

713
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:47,680
But Chen Hewen, you've always

714
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:48,540
