718
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:51,840
Maybe I should talk less.

719
00:20:51,840 --> 00:20:53,440
Maybe I talk too much normally.

720
00:20:53,440 --> 00:20:54,160
No.

721
00:20:54,160 --> 00:20:56,600
Just be your real self.

722
00:20:56,600 --> 00:20:58,160
You're really good
at knowing boundaries.

723
00:20:58,160 --> 00:20:59,520
You know how

724
00:20:59,520 --> 00:21:01,040
