725
00:21:01,440 --> 00:21:02,360
I'm not as good at that as you.

726
00:21:02,360 --> 00:21:02,840
Sometimes

727
00:21:02,840 --> 00:21:04,720
I don't know where the line is.

728
00:21:04,720 --> 00:21:06,160
But I consciously rein myself in

729
00:21:06,160 --> 00:21:07,960
and keep learning.

730
00:21:09,520 --> 00:21:11,840
My impression
of everyone really changed.

731
00:21:11,840 --> 00:21:13,280
I think Chen Hewen also has

732
00:21:13,280 --> 00:21:14,800
