744
00:21:30,800 --> 00:21:32,640
I thought you were kind of aloof.

745
00:21:34,120 --> 00:21:35,720
Like maybe you were...

746
00:21:35,880 --> 00:21:36,800
A little distant.

747
00:21:37,080 --> 00:21:38,160
Yeah.

748
00:21:38,440 --> 00:21:39,360
But today,

749
00:21:39,360 --> 00:21:40,320
I saw so many good sides of everyone.

750
00:21:40,760 --> 00:21:41,760
Yeah, whenever we're free,

751
00:21:41,760 --> 00:21:42,800
